// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in. Values become build settings;
// expose one to Swift by adding `MY_KEY: $(MY_KEY)` under the target's info.properties
// in project.yml, then read Bundle.main.object(forInfoDictionaryKey: "MY_KEY").
// Note: "//" starts a comment in xcconfig, so write URLs as https:/$()/example.com
// DEV_API_KEY = your-key-here
